#chapter-opener(2, "Property, Taxes and Anything I Own a Piece Of",
  [Not everything I own sits in a bank. Write down the property, vehicles and businesses you own, and who handles your taxes. Never write a full title, deed, plate or tax number here. Write only where the paper is kept.])

#elp-heading[My Home]
#elp-field[Address]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(hint: [(own, rent, or live with family)])[I Own / Rent]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 2, hint: [(a drawer, a safe, my attorney, the county office)])[Where the Deed Is Kept]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(hint: [(bank and phone, or "paid off")])[Mortgage or Lender]
#elp-gap
#elp-field[Property Tax Paid By]

#pagebreak()

#elp-heading[Other Property I Own]
Land, a rental, a second home, a timeshare, a cemetery plot.
#v(0.1in)
#elp-table(("Property and Where", "Where the Deed Is Kept", "Who Manages It"),
  rows: 5, row-h: 0.6in, widths: (2.6in, 2.4in, 2.0in))
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 2, hint: [(a property manager, a tenant, a neighbor)])[Who Has Keys or Collects Rent]

#pagebreak()

#elp-heading[Vehicles]
#elp-table(("Vehicle (Year, Make)", "Where the Title Is Kept", "Loan? (Lender)"),
  rows: 5, row-h: 0.6in, widths: (2.4in, 2.6in, 2.0in))
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 2, hint: [(cars, a boat, a trailer, a motorcycle, an RV)])[Others I Own]
#elp-gap
#elp-field[Where the Spare Keys Are]

#pagebreak()

#elp-heading[Businesses and Partnerships]
A business I own, a share in a partnership, a farm, a family company.
#v(0.1in)
#elp-table(("Business Name", "My Share", "Partner or Manager", "Phone"),
  rows: 4, row-h: 0.6in, widths: (2.2in, 1.2in, 2.2in, 1.4in))
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 2, hint: [(an operating agreement, a buy-sell agreement)])[Where Its Papers Are Kept]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 2)[Who Should Run It or Close It]

#pagebreak()

#elp-heading[My Accountant and Tax Preparer]
#elp-field[Name]
#elp-gap
#elp-field[Firm]
#elp-gap
#elp-field[Phone]
#elp-gap
#elp-field[Email]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(hint: [(or "I do my own")])[Who Prepares My Taxes]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 2, hint: [(the kinds of work this person does for me)])[What This Person Handles]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 2)[Other Tax Contact, If Any]

#pagebreak()

#elp-heading[My Tax Returns and Records]
My returns: see Where My Important Papers Are.
#v(0.1in)
#elp-field(hint: [(for example, 7 years)])[How Far Back I Keep Them]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 2, hint: [(a filing cabinet, a box, a computer folder)])[Where Older Records Are]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(hint: [(MM/DD/YYYY)])[Date of My Last Return]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 2, hint: [(a refund due, a balance owed, a payment plan)])[Taxes Still Open]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 3)[Notes for My Family]
